# Unlicensed Hearse: "{T}: Exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard" and its power and toughness equal the cards
# exiled with it (CR 607.2a, 604.3), though it is no creature until crewed. Bot2 Bolts Bot1 twice, so its graveyard holds two
# Lightning Bolts, and Bot1's own graveyard holds a Bolt. The Hearse taps for Bot2's two Bolts and is 2/2; a card from the other
# graveyard cannot be the second target (the refusal beside the allowed second card). Crewed by a Bramble Familiar, it is a 2/2
# creature (the dump shows a power only for creatures).

